{
  "name": "工单通知超时检查",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -352,
        -48
      ],
      "id": "aea41f43-89c5-46c5-8350-de7552867d9f",
      "name": "When clicking ‘Execute workflow’"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT ticket_id, notification_status, assigned_agent, intent, priority,\n       notification_claimed_at, notification_attempts\nFROM tickets\nWHERE notification_status = 'processing'\n  AND notification_alerted_at IS NULL\n  AND (\n      notification_claimed_at IS NULL\n      OR notification_claimed_at < NOW() - INTERVAL 10 MINUTE\n  )\nORDER BY notification_claimed_at, ticket_id;",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.mySql",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        -128,
        -48
      ],
      "id": "1d4c987c-5bc7-44a1-8358-ec417cf55f8d",
      "name": "Execute a SQL query"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "sender@example.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('读取超时通知收件人').item.json.agent_email }}",
        "subject": "=【坐席超时提醒】工单 #{{ $('读取超时通知收件人').item.json.ticket_id }}",
        "html": "=<p>工单通知已超过 10 分钟仍处于处理中，请核对邮件发送记录并联系客户。</p><p>工单号：{{ $('读取超时通知收件人').item.json.ticket_id }}</p><p>负责坐席：{{ $('读取超时通知收件人').item.json.assigned_agent || '未分配' }}</p><p>认领时间：{{ $('Execute a SQL query').item.json.notification_claimed_at || '未知' }}</p><p>若已发送原通知，请勿重复处理；若发送失败，请按坐席工作台流程联系客户。</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        220
      ],
      "id": "b37302d9-af38-4485-b278-1abfbd25536b",
      "name": "发送坐席超时提醒",
      "webhookId": "1220ebd3-a130-4af3-b5ee-26baacc22e50"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "UPDATE tickets\nSET notification_alerted_at = NOW()\nWHERE ticket_id = $1\n  AND notification_status = 'processing'\n  AND notification_alerted_at IS NULL\n  AND notification_claimed_at <=> $2;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [\n  $('Execute a SQL query').item.json.ticket_id,\n  $('Execute a SQL query').item.json.notification_claimed_at\n] }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.mySql",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
